    "text": "**Business & market dynamics:** Viemed is riding strong demand for its technology-enabled, home-based respiratory and chronic disease management services. Secular tailwinds—an aging population and the shift toward lower-cost, in‑home care—are fueling sustained volume growth. The company is expanding its national footprint through a mix of organic growth and bolt‑on acquisitions, building momentum across core service lines without signs of softening.\n\n**Management strategy and execution:** Leadership tightened and raised its full-year 2026 outlook while launching a share repurchase program, signaling confidence in the growth trajectory and robust free cash flow. The capital allocation framework balances organic reinvestment, tuck‑in M&A, and shareholder returns, with a disciplined capex posture. Consistent delivery on targets and transparent guidance reinforce credibility with the market.",
